{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8c93ec6ef5ab1ced","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Llama Stack\n2\t\n3\t**Jira component**: Llama Stack\n4\t**Maturity**: Tech Preview\n5\t**Owning team**: RHOAI GenAI\n6\t**Upstream**: meta-llama/llama-stack\n7\t**Midstream**: opendatahub-io/llama-stack-k8s-operator\n8\t**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n9\t\n10\t## Role in the platform\n11\t\n12\tUnified GenAI API layer (inference, RAG, agents, safety, eval) deployed as a\n13\tLlamaStackDistribution CR. Positions the platform's OpenAI-compatible endpoint\n14\tsurface and provider-plugin model. The eval provider API exists upstream but no\n15\tproduction eval provider is wired in the platform distribution yet.\n16\t\n17\t## Dependencies\n18\t\n19\t- vLLM (Serving Runtimes) as the default inference provider\n20\t- Milvus/vector providers for RAG workflows (optional)\n21\t\n22\t## Interfaces\n23\t\n24\t- LlamaStackDistribution CRD (llamastack.io)\n25\t- OpenAI-compatible REST APIs; provider plugins configured per distribution\n26\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd31ab5e39a5836d","agent_id":"acab439dfc0167f5d","session_id":"6fdcac3b-4fd7-476b-9907-b8d1706b4a31","uuid":"c14fe340-95f0-44a4-99dc-76412b538f7a","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:00:37.369Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8c93ec6ef5ab1ced","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9007"}
