tation (docs-authoring) | RHOAI Documentation | P1 |\n66\t\n67\t## Dependency DAG\n68\t\n69\t```mermaid\n70\tgraph TD\n71\t    E001[E001 posture decision Investigation]\n72\t\n73\t    subgraph BranchA[Branch A - platform-managed]\n74\t        AE002[A-E002 Milvus repo-onboarding]\n75\t        AE003[A-E003 Milvus license-validation]\n76\t        AE004[A-E004 Milvus konflux-onboarding]\n77\t        AE005[A-E005 Operator managed Milvus deployment]\n78\t        AE006[A-E006 Llama Stack RAG provider wiring]\n79\t        AE007[A-E007 Dashboard deploy-and-manage UI]\n80\t        AE008[A-E008 managed-posture documentation]\n81\t        AE002 --> AE004\n82\t        AE003 --> AE005\n83\t        AE005 --> AE006\n84\t        AE005 --> AE007\n85\t        AE002 --> AE008\n86\t        AE003 --> AE008\n87\t        AE004 --> AE008\n88\t        AE005 --> AE008\n89\t        AE006 --> AE008\n90\t        AE007 --> AE008\n91\t    end\n92\t\n93\t    subgraph BranchB[Branch B - external-connection-only]\n94\t        BE002[B-E002 Operator connection registration]\n95\t        BE003[B-E003 Llama Stack provider wiring]\n96\t        BE004[B-E004 Dashboard connection UI]\n97\t        BE005[B-E005 external-posture documentation]\n98\t        BE002 --> BE003\n99\t        BE002 --> BE004\n100\t        BE002 --> BE005\n101\t        BE003 --> BE005\n102\t        BE004 --> BE005\n103\t    end\n104\t\n105\t    E001 --> AE002\n106\t    E001 --> AE003\n107\t    E001 --> AE004\n108\t    E001 --> AE005\n109\t    E001 --> AE006\n110\t    E001 --> AE007\n111\t    E001 --> AE008\n112\t    E001 --> BE002\n113\t    E001 --> BE003\n114\t    E001 --> BE004\n115\t    E001 --> BE005\n116\t```\n117\t\n118\tNote: the `E001 --> A-E004` edge is implied transitively via `A-E002`; it is\n119\tdrawn because every branch epic is gated by the Investigation (`gated_by`\n120\tmust be a member of `dependencies`). `A-E004` (konflux-onboarding) and\n121\t`A-E005` (operator implementation) have **no edge between them** by Rule 10