es (e.g., cloud vector DB services); and the\n47\t  relative delivery timelines.\n48\t- Produce a documented evaluation (not just a verdict) that stakeholders can\n49\t  audit, per the strategy's requirement for a documented decision record.\n50\t- Record a single, signed-off posture decision and identify which conditional\n51\t  implementation plan proceeds.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- A written evaluation exists that compares platform-managed\n56\t  (operator-deployed Milvus) against external-connection-only on:\n57\t  supportability cost, disconnected-environment viability, and\n58\t  time-to-market.\n59\t- The evaluation states its evidence sources and assumptions.\n60\t- A single posture decision is recorded and signed off by the accountable\n61\t  product/architecture stakeholders.\n62\t- The decision record identifies which conditional downstream implementation\n63\t  path (managed or external-connection) is activated, so downstream planning\n64\t  can start immediately.\n65\t- Out-of-scope guardrail is respected: the decision covers only the *first*\n66\t  supported posture; shipping both postures in the same release remains out\n67\t  of scope.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- **HLR-1 (P0)**: \"A decision is reached, with a documented evaluation, on the\n72\t  first supported vector store posture: platform-managed (operator-deployed\n73\t  Milvus) versus external-connection-only.\" — fully covered by this\n74\t  investigation.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-99d8eb620e547779","agent_id":"ac7fe1d2a48a6c62c","session_id":"6fdcac3b-4fd7-476b-9907-b8d1706b4a31","uuid":"4f18ed84-420b-41c6-94e9-f79d60c38f08","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:24:39.524Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b759b500dff06aec","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9007"}
