eam consumers — Llama Stack\n50\t  distribution wiring and the Dashboard — can build against.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- A data scientist can register an external vector store connection scoped\n55\t  to a project.\n56\t- Registration validates connectivity to the external store; failures are\n57\t  surfaced rather than silently accepted.\n58\t- The registered connection is consumable by platform components through a\n59\t  defined interface (no hand-copied secrets or out-of-band config).\n60\t- Connections are isolated per project.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- **HLR-2 (P0)** (external-connection branch): \"data scientists can register\n65\t  an external vector store connection per project with validated\n66\t  connectivity\" — primary coverage.\n67\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-99d8eb620e547779","agent_id":"ac7fe1d2a48a6c62c","session_id":"6fdcac3b-4fd7-476b-9907-b8d1706b4a31","uuid":"4a08d412-a912-4bfb-9e5a-7045f2c8ff2c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:25:34.540Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ad7ede861ce811ca","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9007"}
